IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `aiida-awards`

-- Arbitration (International Investment Disputes) Act 1968, ss 2(2), 3, 4, 5, 8, 9 and Schedule Articles 20-27, 37-39, 49-53, 61(1) -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_arbitration-international-investment-disputes-act-1968.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

